{
  "_frozen": "Capture contract as published in docs/api/openapi.json on 2026-10-27, before personnel attendance. Descriptions stripped. Do NOT regenerate from the live document: this file exists so a future change cannot silently move the baseline. Edit only by a deliberate, reviewed contract decision.",
  "_deviations": [
    "TapResult.record and TapBatchRowResult.record: openapi 3.0 cannot put nullable beside $ref; the wire sends JSON null on a refusal, so they are marked nullable here.",
    "CardNotFoundProblem is observed wire shape, not a published schema: the ProblemDetails schema in openapi is open. Captured 2026-10-27 from POST /attendance/tap; note RFC 7807 'type' is NOT emitted today."
  ],
  "_amended": [
    "2026-10-28, ADR-015 B1c-1 (D-99), deliberate: every capture code field gains an enum of the 14 TapOutcomeCode tokens published before personnel attendance, so a v1 client can never be sent PersonnelInactive or PersonnelNotInAudience.",
    "2026-10-28, ADR-015 B1c-1 (D-99), deliberate: StudentDto and CardDto added, frozen from the same pre-personnel openapi.json, for GET /students/by-card/{cardUid}."
  ],
